\section{Putting it together --- network strategy}

\begin{enumerate}
  \item Redraw: mark series/parallel groups; look for shorts and equipotentials.
  \item Replace groups by $R_{\mathrm{eq}}$ until one loop remains (if possible).
  \item Include internal $r$ with the cell: $\mathcal{E}=I(R_{\mathrm{eq}}+r)$.
  \item Recover branch currents and voltages with dividers / Ohm's law.
  \item Finish with power $P=VI=I^{2}R=V^{2}/R$ if asked.
\end{enumerate}

